    "title"             "Knox Relay"
    "description"       "Server-side bridge mod for remote server management. Exports game state, inventory snapshots, player positions, progression, live character vitals and appearance, and processes item delivery and money deposit queues via file-based JSON communication. Provides /account register for linking a character to a website account, and /report for filing a player report from inside the game."
    "changenote"        "[h1]1.26 — Panel pulse, Desk inbox, held returns[/h1]\n[b]Added[/b]\n[list]\n[*]Typed panel jobs so a website Refresh waits for a real inventory snapshot instead of guessing.\n[*]A one-second real-time pulse for snapshot requests, deliveries, and Desk traffic — still runs when the world is paused empty.\n[*]Capability flags in game_state.json so the panel can see what this build actually supports.\n[*]Knox Desk Inbox: sold, won, and unsold auction listings show up in-game.\n[/list]\n[b]Changed[/b]\n[list]\n[*]Player names match case-insensitively, so a website account that differs in capitalisation still finds you.\n[*]Unsold and cancelled auction items return to the vault as held stacks (no slot, no retrieve fee) instead of being stuffed back into pockets.\n[/list]"
}
